# Antigravity Rules

This project references shared guidelines.

If a `_guidelines/` folder exists in the project root:
  - Read `_guidelines/_index/MASTER_INDEX.md` to discover relevant files
  - Prefix all file loads with `_guidelines/`

Otherwise, use the canonical source:
  - Base path: `D:\WebApps\global-guidelines-for-a-vibe-coder/`
  - Start with `guidelines/_index/MASTER_INDEX.md` from that path
